        <h1>Privacy Policy for WeatherGlow</h1>
        <div class="doc-meta">
            <span>Application: </span><strong>WeatherGlow</strong> • <span>Package: </span><span class="code-inline">com.neurontslabs.weatherglow</span> • <span>Effective Date: September 1, 2026</span>
        </div>
